#!/bin/bash

# tam-screensaver — run the screensaver: random ttfx effects over the
# screensaver text, until a key is pressed or the window loses focus.
# tam-launch-screensaver starts it in its own terminal window.
#
# Ported from omarchy 4.0.4 (omarchy-screensaver) for plan 18 R4.12.
# Changed: the window class (org.tamlinux.screensaver), XDG Tamlinux
# branding text and immutable default text from the same command output.
